{
  "handle": "openframe",
  "variant": "3in",
  "content": {
    "product": "openframe",
    "variant": "3\" Freestyle"
  },
  "sources": [
    "scripts/in-the-box/models/openframe-3in.glb"
  ],
  "camera": {
    "tiltDeg": 12
  },
  "layout": {
    "gapMm": 7,
    "sectionGapMm": 8,
    "aspect": 1.2
  },
  "notes": [
    "Source is a glTF built from the final STEP export (assembly with electronics): carbon, aluminium, TPU and kit hardware only; motors, props, boards, DJI O4 and the 2 M3x6 under the bumper M3x8 are left out when the model is built.",
    "TPU colours are the CAD appearance colours: boots, bumper and AirTag/antenna mount green (PCB green), camera soft mounts black. VTX-Mount and xt30Mount are orange in the CAD and rendered black (founder 2026-10-24: shipped TPU is black and green).",
    "Kit quantities: frame count plus 2 spares of every screw and nut kind (extra); washers, grommets and standoffs are exactly the frame count. Press nuts are pressed into the carbon by the supplier and not shown.",
    "3 inch has Cam-Mount-L and Cam-Mount-R.",
    "Aluminium camera side plates: Pantone 7549 C gold anodising #FBB600 (founder 2026-10-24). Standoffs: natural aluminium."
  ],
  "groups": [
    {
      "label": "Build card",
      "procedural": {
        "kind": "card",
        "w": 105,
        "h": 148,
        "caption": "OpenFrame 3″ · Build card",
        "illustration": "^(Top|Base-Top|Base-Bot|Arm|Cross)$"
      },
      "row": 1,
      "item": "Build card"
    },
    {
      "label": "Top plate",
      "match": "^Top$",
      "finish": "carbon",
      "row": 1,
      "item": "Carbon plates"
    },
    {
      "label": "Base plates",
      "match": "^Base-(Top|Bot)$",
      "finish": "carbon",
      "row": 1,
      "item": "Carbon plates"
    },
    {
      "label": "Arms",
      "match": "^Arm$",
      "finish": "carbon",
      "row": 2,
      "item": "3\" carbon arms",
      "lay": "x",
      "perRow": 2
    },
    {
      "label": "Cross brace",
      "match": "^Cross$",
      "finish": "carbon",
      "item": "Carbon cross",
      "below": "Antenna mount"
    },
    {
      "label": "Standoffs 20 mm",
      "match": "^Standoff M3 F-F 20 OD5$",
      "finish": "alu",
      "color": "#b4b8bf",
      "row": 3,
      "item": "Hardware kit",
      "material": {
        "roughness": 0.4
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "Camera mount pair",
      "match": "^Standoff-(L|R)$",
      "finish": "alu",
      "color": "#FBB600",
      "material": {
        "roughness": 0.55
      },
      "row": 3,
      "item": "CNC aluminium camera mount pair"
    },
    {
      "label": "Arm boots",
      "match": "^boot[FR][LR]$|^Boot-[LR]$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#023208",
      "item": "TPU arm boots",
      "below": "Camera mount pair",
      "perRow": 4
    },
    {
      "label": "Antenna mount",
      "match": "^Airtag/Antenna[- ][Mm]ount$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#023208",
      "row": 3,
      "item": "TPU AirTag and antenna mount"
    },
    {
      "label": "Air unit mount",
      "match": "^VTX-Mount$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#17181a",
      "item": "TPU air unit mount"
    },
    {
      "label": "Camera soft mounts",
      "match": "^Cam-Mount-[LR]$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#17181a",
      "item": "TPU camera soft mounts",
      "perRow": 2
    },
    {
      "label": "Bumper",
      "match": "^Bumpr$|^Bumper$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#023208",
      "item": "TPU bumper"
    },
    {
      "label": "XT30 mount",
      "match": "^xt30Mount$",
      "finish": "tpu",
      "color": "#17181a",
      "item": "TPU XT30 mount"
    },
    {
      "label": "Sticker",
      "procedural": {
        "kind": "sticker",
        "w": 80,
        "h": 22
      },
      "row": 3,
      "item": "Sticker"
    },
    {
      "label": "Battery straps",
      "procedural": {
        "kind": "strap",
        "w": 15,
        "len": 200
      },
      "count": 2,
      "perRow": 1,
      "row": 4,
      "item": "Battery straps",
      "lay": "x"
    },
    {
      "label": "Anti-slip pad",
      "match": "^anti-slip pad$",
      "finish": "rubber",
      "color": "#1d1e21",
      "decal": {
        "art": "incutec",
        "base": "#1d1e21",
        "widthFrac": 0.5,
        "alpha": 0.85
      },
      "note": "GLB colours are placeholder grey and white; the pad is dark silicone with the Incutec wordmark",
      "item": "Anti-slip battery pad",
      "lay": "x",
      "below": "Sticker"
    },
    {
